  "intro": {
    "text": "Put *en* before an adjective for **the most**: *en büyük* (the biggest), *en iyi* (the best). For **the … in a group**, use the genitive and a possessive: *Türkiye'nin en büyük şehri* (Turkey's biggest city), *sınıfın en iyi öğrencisi* (the best student in the class).",
    "see": "gp-superlative"
  },
